{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394350/extras/wishlist-now-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1740584130\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Divine Wish</strong> is a first-person roguelike shooter with a unique sticker system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive in the surge of battle, choose stickers that change your abilities and characteristics, and compete against waves of enemies in a dynamic FPS roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394350/extras/GIFka-ezgif.com-optimize__1_.gif?t=1740584130\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FPS + roguelike: an explosive mix</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Divine Wish is a high-speed first-person shooter where each run is a unique challenge. Explore random combinations of weapons and artifacts, adapt to new threats, and prove your skills in boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speed, reaction, and accuracy are key skills for your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No saves - every death brings you back to the beginning, but with a new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each attempt is unique thanks to a system of classes and random artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stickers that change your abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no classic character classes in Divine Wish - you choose how to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before each race, you get a sticker that gives you unique effects and changes the gameplay. But it's not that simple - each sticker gives you both a powerful bonus and a weakness, so you have to choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boss battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every 10th wave is an epic boss battle that will test your skills to the brim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique attacks and mechanics make you adapt to each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gradual increase in difficulty ensures that you will not have an easy time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only the best players will be able to defeat all the bosses and complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Death is only the beginning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As in any roguelike, each run is a chance to become stronger. Explore enemies, experiment with stickers, and find your perfect playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Divine Wish is an explosive combination of roguelike and FPS. Ready to take on the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A burning sensation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394350/2a1e836f826f3eb519c6869a461f709ea68cea03.jpg"},{"name":"A cake?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394350/783656935300451bd778005966faecd08ba4bb6b.jpg"},{"name":"One more thing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394350/149a45fd243b31e34b5ad3dcfc463863256f24d1.jpg"},{"name":"A destroyer of worlds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394350/c9fe97eabf3539cfe8d5e87c7deddf69af521930.jpg"},{"name":"MORE GUNS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394350/95b8be628f4a46f4387804025a7ee7ce65860201.jpg"},{"name":"Master Swordsman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394350/1bc79e62cdb7995155380a3f6e81e221dd984588.jpg"},{"name":"Pirate Economy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394350/16b4c63c4e1e95d293b1c968b47a105bf85397b4.jpg"},{"name":"Blunt Force","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394350/09b8896c592bb5bda2ba34292babf5797a59d2e9.jpg"},{"name":"Showtime!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394350/72bd4f99f75b1ebf0721586896d944350f00fbeb.jpg"},{"name":"Hard Dash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394350/722a44cf1e74c4a600582779c5cc7c38cb2f8235.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3394350?t=1740584130","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740584130","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394350/a97bedc55cc3a0df228dca83072bb2ef3f15fab9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740584130","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394350/a97bedc55cc3a0df228dca83072bb2ef3f15fab9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740584130","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394350/extras/wishlist-now-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1740584130\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Divine Wish</strong> is a first-person roguelike shooter with a unique sticker system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive in the surge of battle, choose stickers that change your abilities and characteristics, and compete against waves of enemies in a dynamic FPS roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394350/extras/GIFka-ezgif.com-optimize__1_.gif?t=1740584130\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FPS + roguelike: an explosive mix</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Divine Wish is a high-speed first-person shooter where each run is a unique challenge. Explore random combinations of weapons and artifacts, adapt to new threats, and prove your skills in boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speed, reaction, and accuracy are key skills for your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No saves - every death brings you back to the beginning, but with a new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each attempt is unique thanks to a system of classes and random artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stickers that change your abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no classic character classes in Divine Wish - you choose how to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before each race, you get a sticker that gives you unique effects and changes the gameplay. But it's not that simple - each sticker gives you both a powerful bonus and a weakness, so you have to choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boss battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every 10th wave is an epic boss battle that will test your skills to the brim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique attacks and mechanics make you adapt to each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gradual increase in difficulty ensures that you will not have an easy time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only the best players will be able to defeat all the bosses and complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Death is only the beginning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As in any roguelike, each run is a chance to become stronger. Explore enemies, experiment with stickers, and find your perfect playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Divine Wish is an explosive combination of roguelike and FPS. Ready to take on the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Estel Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3126200","name":"Divine Wish"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394350/header.jpg?t=1740584130","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098275,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098275/movie480.mp4?t=1739496661","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098275/movie_max.mp4?t=1739496661"},"name":"Divine Wish Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257098275/5d770b50e114f4be8faf0d7112bceb9888c93b38/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739496661","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098275/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739496661","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098275/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739496661"}}],"name":"Divine Wish Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 or AMD Radeon HD 7870<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>",